name: sim.setObjectStringParam
description: Deprecated. See properties instead
luaSynopsis: sim.setObjectStringParam(int objectHandle, int parameterID, string/bytes parameter)
pythonSynopsis: sim.setObjectStringParam(int objectHandle, int parameterID, buffer parameter)
inputs:
1. objectHandle: handle of the object
2. parameterID: identifier of the parameter to set. See the list of all possible object parameters
3. parameter: parameter value (can contain embedded zeros)
outputs:
